  <p>Briefly describe the program/project and purpose for which funds are being requested:</p>
  <p>Athletics plans to address its growing academic space issues by expanding in the following ways:</p>
  <ol>
    <li>Upgrade the <span data-field="facility_name">{{ facility_name }}</span> located on <span data-field="campus_location">{{ campus_location }}</span>.</li>
    <li>Create an on-campus study center for student-athletes in athletic space located in YUH; and</li>
